# Mixamo intermediates: regenerated by `npm run assets:mixamo` from the FBX
# downloads, which are not committed either. The shipped, compressed copies in
# public/models/ ARE committed, so a clone still builds and runs. Keeping these
# would put a ~33 MB blob in history on every character re-download.
assets_raw/archer_mx.glb
assets_raw/anim_aim.glb
assets_raw/anim_death.glb
